flowchart LR
    AUTHOR["✍️ Author writes
    2 KB articles
    (doc + source)"] --> RELOAD["🔄 pi /reload"]

    RELOAD --> EXT["📦 kb-skills extension
    hooks resources_discover"]

    EXT --> SCAN["🔍 Scan KB articles"]
    SCAN --> VALIDATE["✅ Validate & filter"]
    VALIDATE --> GEN["📁 Generate cache skills"]

    GEN --> PI["🧠 pi discovers skills
    ready for use"]

    PI --> ITERATE["💡 Use / improve skills"]
    ITERATE -->|Edit KB article| RELOAD
